    "methods_description": "MEG data were collected across 13 scanner runs per subject (5 for subject 1), comprising a localizer task (runs 1-3/1-5), non-analyzed probability learning task (runs 4-5), and risky decision-making task (runs 6-13/8-15). Event timing was recorded using a photodiode accessible as a MEG channel. Data were preprocessed and epoched from 0-500 ms following task events including gamble information onset, probability stimulus presentation, response, and outcome onset.",
